Section 8,

1716
00:46:56,640 --> 00:46:57,340
the deep math,

1717
00:46:57,620 --> 00:46:58,760
calculus of constructions,

1718
00:46:58,900 --> 00:46:59,600
and BNF.

1719
00:47:00,000 --> 00:47:00,720
To mathematically

1720
00:47:00,720 --> 00:47:01,940
bind this entire

1721
00:47:01,940 --> 00:47:02,800
universe together,

