1897
00:50:29,140 --> 00:50:29,660
I want to focus

1898
00:50:29,660 --> 00:50:30,280
on that last one.

1899
00:50:30,740 --> 00:50:31,520
What in the world

1900
00:50:31,520 --> 00:50:33,400
is active geodesic inference?

1901
00:50:33,880 --> 00:50:34,680
This is the moment

1902
00:50:34,680 --> 00:50:35,220
in the paper

1903
00:50:35,220 --> 00:50:36,000
where affliction

1904
00:50:36,000 --> 00:50:37,440
stretches the architecture

1905
00:50:37,440 --> 00:50:38,880
beyond computer science

1906
00:50:38,880 --> 00:50:40,940
and into theoretical physics

1907
00:50:40,940 --> 00:50:42,240
and artificial intelligence.

1908
00:50:42,840 --> 00:50:43,860
The author proposes

1909
00:50:43,860 --> 00:50:44,920
a new definition

1910
00:50:44,920 --> 00:50:46,400
of intelligence itself.

1911
00:50:46,960 --> 00:50:47,840
In this framework,

1912
00:50:48,040 --> 00:50:49,460
