1922
00:51:01,260 --> 00:51:02,440
Let's unpack that carefully.

1923
00:51:02,620 --> 00:51:03,940
Low action trajectories.

1924
00:51:04,320 --> 00:51:05,140
Imagine a hiker

1925
00:51:05,140 --> 00:51:06,060
