1987
00:52:18,020 --> 00:52:19,040
Civilization is note

1988
00:52:19,040 --> 00:52:19,680
infrastructure.

1989
00:52:19,980 --> 00:52:21,140
We zoom out from code,

1990
00:52:21,500 --> 00:52:22,580
from category theory,

1991
00:52:22,800 --> 00:52:23,940
from artificial intelligence,

1992
00:52:23,940 --> 00:52:25,040
all the way to the

1993
00:52:25,040 --> 00:52:26,060
